{{$DOOM := 35}}{{/* CC number of the time's-up announcer, or 0 */}}

{{ephemeralResponse}}
{{$uid := .User.ID}}
{{$e := dbGet $uid "kod"}}
{{if not $e}}♦️ You're not in the game yet — hit **Deal me in** first.{{return}}{{end}}
{{$g := $e.Value}}
{{$s := toString (index $g "state")}}
{{if eq $s "won"}}✅ You're already cured. Put the glass down.{{return}}{{end}}
{{if ne $s "playing"}}💀 You're dead. **Deal me in** to sit down again.{{return}}{{end}}

{{$dl := toInt (index $g "dl")}}
{{$map := toString (index $g "map")}}
{{$stockS := toString (index $g "stock")}}

{{if gt currentTime.Unix $dl}}
{{dbSet $uid "kod" (sdict "map" $map "dl" $dl "dose" (toInt (index $g "dose")) "course" (toInt (index $g "course")) "state" "expired" "stock" $stockS)}}
{{sendMessage nil (print "⏱️💀 The room stopped spinning for **" .User.Username "**. The poison finished its work.")}}
⏱️ **Time ran out.**{{return}}
{{end}}

{{$ml := split $map ""}}
{{$codes := .Values}}

{{$REQ := cslice (cslice (index $ml 4) (index $ml 3)) (cslice (index $ml 6)) (cslice (index $ml 1) (index $ml 2) (index $ml 5) (index $ml 7)) (cslice (index $ml 1) (index $ml 3) (index $ml 4) (index $ml 7))}}
{{$dose := toInt (index $g "dose")}}
{{$course := toInt (index $g "course")}}
{{$need := index $REQ $dose}}
{{$ok := eq (len $codes) (len $need)}}
{{if $ok}}{{range $c := $need}}{{if not (in $codes $c)}}{{$ok = false}}{{end}}{{end}}{{end}}

{{if $ok}}
{{$dose = add $dose 1}}
{{if eq $dose 4}}
{{dbSet $uid "kod" (sdict "map" $map "dl" $dl "dose" $dose "course" $course "state" "won" "stock" $stockS)}}
{{if $DOOM}}{{cancelScheduledUniqueCC $DOOM (print "kodoom" $uid)}}{{end}}
{{sendMessage nil (print "🏆 **THE HUSH TAKES THE ROOM.** **" .User.Username "** is cured — course " $course " of 3, with time to spare.")}}
# 🏆 Cured.
Every sound drops out — the ice, the traffic, the blood in your ears. When it comes back, the poison is gone.

The diamond card on the bar is gone too.
{{else}}
{{dbSet $uid "kod" (sdict "map" $map "dl" $dl "dose" $dose "course" $course "state" "playing" "stock" $stockS)}}
{{$flav := cslice "The tremor in your hands stops. Something in this is working." "Your vision clears at the edges. Two down." "The taste of copper leaves your mouth. One more."}}
🩸 **Dose {{$dose}} of 4 holds down.**
> *{{index $flav (sub $dose 1)}}*
Course {{$course}} of 3 still alive. ⏱️ <t:{{$dl}}:R>
{{end}}
{{else}}
{{$course = add $course 1}}
{{if gt $course 3}}
{{dbSet $uid "kod" (sdict "map" $map "dl" $dl "dose" 0 "course" $course "state" "dead" "stock" $stockS)}}
{{if $DOOM}}{{cancelScheduledUniqueCC $DOOM (print "kodoom" $uid)}}{{end}}
{{sendMessage nil (print "💀 **" .User.Username "**'s heart stops. The glass rolls off the bar and doesn't break.")}}
# 💀 Your heart stops.
The fourth wrong drink was one too many.

*Your order was:* `{{index $ml 4}}{{index $ml 3}}` → `{{index $ml 6}}` → `{{index $ml 1}}{{index $ml 2}}{{index $ml 5}}{{index $ml 7}}` → `{{index $ml 1}}{{index $ml 3}}{{index $ml 4}}{{index $ml 7}}`
{{else}}
{{dbSet $uid "kod" (sdict "map" $map "dl" $dl "dose" 0 "course" $course "state" "playing" "stock" $stockS)}}
🤢 **WRONG.** You bring it straight back up, and the poison digs in deeper.
> *Dose {{add (toInt (index $g "dose")) 1}} was not it. The course resets to the beginning.*
**Course {{$course}} of 3.** {{if eq $course 3}}One left. Make it count.{{end}} ⏱️ <t:{{$dl}}:R>
{{end}}
{{end}}